---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Story Studio | From Idea to Publisher-Ready Book" description="Turn a rough idea into a finished children's book with writing, editing, illustrations, publishing QA, and paid KDP-ready export." path="/tools/story-studio">
  <main>
    <section class="hero wrap">
      <span class="eyebrow">THE TOOL SHED · STORY STUDIO</span>
      <h1>Don’t stop at a draft. Finish the book.</h1>
      <p>Story Studio turns an idea into a structured, edited, illustrated project. Paid children’s-book projects can finish as a 24-page publisher package with KDP-ready interior and cover PDFs, manuscript, metadata, and an upload checklist.</p>
      <div class="actions"><a class="primary" href="/account?next=/app/story-studio">Start Free</a><a class="secondary" href="#publisher">See the finished package</a></div>
      <div class="pipeline" aria-label="Creation pipeline"><span>Idea</span><b>→</b><span>Story Bible</span><b>→</b><span>Write</span><b>→</b><span>Edit</span><b>→</b><span>Illustrate</span><b>→</b><span>QA</span><b>→</b><span>Export</span></div>
    </section>

    <section id="publisher" class="wrap section">
      <div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">THE PAID-TIER DIFFERENCE</span><h2>A deliverable, not another blinking cursor.</h2><p>Children’s books are the first fully finished format because apparently even software needs to learn to walk before attempting a 300-page fantasy trilogy.</p></div>
      <div class="grid three">
        <article><h3>24-page interior</h3><p>8.5 × 8.5 inch children’s-book layout with bleed-aware PDF generation and a page-by-page manuscript.</p></article>
        <article><h3>Consistent illustrations</h3><p>Story Bible and visual locks feed the illustration prompts, with 12 planned illustration slots and visual QA before generation.</p></article>
        <article><h3>Publisher package</h3><p>Separate interior PDF, full-wrap cover PDF, manuscript, metadata file, and upload checklist bundled into one ZIP.</p></article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="wrap section">
      <div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">CREATION SYSTEM</span><h2>Multiple stages. One project memory.</h2></div>
      <div class="grid four feature-grid">
        <article><h3>Story architect</h3><p>Builds premise, characters, setting, continuity rules, audience guardrails, and outline.</p></article>
        <article><h3>Writer + editor</h3><p>Drafts against canon, then performs developmental and copy editing rather than trusting the first AI answer like a maniac.</p></article>
        <article><h3>Image direction</h3><p>Creates character and style locks before image generation to reduce visual drift across pages.</p></article>
        <article><h3>Publishing QA</h3><p>Rejects weak or inconsistent output before the final project is marked ready to export.</p></article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="wrap section beta">
      <div><span class="eyebrow">COMIC BOOK BETA</span><h2>Comics are paid beta.</h2><p>Comic projects are kept off the Free tier. The beta can develop story, scenes, characters, and visual direction, but Story Studio does not yet market comics as publisher-ready finished books.</p></div>
      <a class="secondary beta-link" href="/app/story-studio/comic-beta">Open Comic Beta</a>
    </section>

    <section class="wrap section pricing">
      <div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">PRICING</span><h2>Sample it free. Pay for the finished machinery.</h2></div>
      <div class="grid four">
        <article class="plan"><h3>Free</h3><strong>$0</strong><p>1 active project<br>2,500 words/month<br>1 sample image/month<br>Draft/prototype only<br>No publisher export</p><a href="/account?next=/app/story-studio">Start Free</a></article>
        <article class="plan"><h3>Creator</h3><strong>$15/mo</strong><p>5 active projects<br>50,000 words/month<br>25 images/month<br>Commercial use<br>KDP / publisher export</p></article>
        <article class="plan featured"><span class="badge">POPULAR</span><h3>Author</h3><strong>$29/mo</strong><p>15 active projects<br>150,000 words/month<br>75 images/month<br>Full children’s-book pipeline<br>KDP / publisher export</p></article>
        <article class="plan"><h3>Studio</h3><strong>$59/mo</strong><p>50 active projects<br>400,000 words/month<br>200 images/month<br>Heavy visual production<br>KDP / publisher export</p></article>
      </div>
      <p class="billing-note">KDP-ready means Story Studio formats the files for upload. Amazon KDP and other publishers retain final acceptance authority. Paid checkout availability depends on the connected billing layer.</p>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
.wrap{width:min(1120px,calc(100% - 2rem));margin-inline:auto}.hero{padding:6.5rem 0 4.5rem;text-align:center}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(2.8rem,8vw,6rem);line-height:.94;letter-spacing:-.055em;max-width:980px;margin:.7rem auto 1.3rem}.hero>p{max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;color:#aaa69e;font-size:1.08rem;line-height:1.7}.eyebrow{font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.16em;font-weight:850;color:#c7a76a}.actions{display:flex;gap:.75rem;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:2rem 0}.actions a,.plan a,.beta-link{padding:.85rem 1rem;border-radius:.55rem;text-decoration:none;font-weight:850}.primary,.plan a{background:#ece6da;color:#111}.secondary{border:1px solid var(--color-border);color:#ece6da}.pipeline{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:.55rem;flex-wrap:wrap;color:#8f8b84;font-size:.78rem;margin-top:2rem}.pipeline span{padding:.4rem .6rem;border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:99px;background:#10110f}.pipeline b{color:#5f5c56}.section{padding:4rem 0}.section-head{max-width:760px;margin-bottom:1.5rem}.section-head h2,.beta h2{font-size:clamp(1.8rem,4vw,3rem);margin:.35rem 0}.section-head p,.beta p{color:#969188;line-height:1.65}.grid{display:grid;gap:1rem}.three{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}.four{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}article{padding:1.3rem;border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:.8rem;background:#10110f}article h3{margin:.2rem 0 .65rem}article p{color:#969188;line-height:1.65}.plan strong{display:block;font-size:1.75rem;margin:.4rem 0}.plan a{display:inline-block;margin-top:.5rem}.featured{border-color:#74613c;position:relative}.badge{position:absolute;right:.8rem;top:.8rem;font-size:.62rem;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#d7b975}.beta{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:2rem;align-items:center;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border);border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-border)}.beta>div{max-width:760px}.beta-link{white-space:nowrap}.billing-note{text-align:center;color:#77736d;font-size:.82rem;margin-top:1rem;line-height:1.6}.pricing{padding-bottom:7rem}@media(max-width:900px){.four{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.three{grid-template-columns:1fr}.beta{display:block}.beta-link{display:inline-block;margin-top:1rem}}@media(max-width:560px){.hero{padding-top:4.5rem}.four{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
